hadiths[400]{hadithnumber,text}:
"609","[AI-translation] ((Je, mnajua kwanini imeitwa Ramadhani? Ni kwa sababu huteketeza dhambi.))"
"610","[AI-translation] ((Msiseme 'Ramadhani' kwa sababu ni jina la Allah; bali mnapaswa kusema 'mwezi wa Ramadhani.' ))"
"611","[AI-translation] ((Fungeni mtapata afya.))"
"612","[AI-translation] ((Kila kitu kina zaka yake, na zaka ya mwili ni saumu.))"
"613","[AI-translation] ((Kila unywele wa mfungaji humtukuza Allah kwa ajili yake, na Siku ya Kiama, meza ya dhahabu itaandikwa chini ya Arshi kwa wanaume wanaofunga na wanawake wanaofunga.))"
"614","[AI-translation] ((Lau Allah Mtukufu angewapa idhini wakaazi wa mbinguni na ardhi kuzungumza, wangewapa bishara njema ya Pepo wale wanaofunga katika mwezi wa Ramadhani.))"
"615","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekosa saumu moja ya Ramadhani bila udhuru halali, juu yake kuna saumu za mwezi mmoja.))"
"616","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekosa saumu moja ya Ramadhani atoe dhabihu ya ngamia.))"
"617","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyekosa saumu moja ya Ramadhani na akafa kabla ya kuilipa, basi kwa kila siku, ni wajibu kulisha masikini mmoja kwa mudu moja [takriban nusu kilo] ya chakula.))"
"618","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayefuturu kwa tende iliyopatikana kwa njia halali, swala mia nne huongezwa kwa swala zake.))"
"619","[AI-translation] ((Ramadhani inapokuwa salama, mwaka mzima huwa salama.))"
"620","[AI-translation] ((Kila siku ya Ramadhani, Allah Mtukufu huwaacha huru watu laki sita kutoka Jahannamu.))"
"621","[AI-translation] ((Allah Mtukufu huwaacha huru watu milioni moja kutoka Jahannamu wakati wa Iftar kila usiku katika Ramadhani.))"
"622","[AI-translation] ((Dua ya mfungaji wakati wa kufuturu haikataliwi.))"
"623","[AI-translation] ((Watu watatu hawataulizwa [Siku ya Kiama] kuhusu chakula na kinywaji: ① Yule anayefuturu ② Yule anayekula daku [suhoor] ③ Yule anayemkaribisha mgeni.))"
"624","[AI-translation] ((Mambo matatu hayavunji saumu: ① Kutapika ② Hijama ③ Ndoto ya unajisi.))"
"625","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyemtazama mwanamke kwa namna ambayo, hata nyuma ya nguo zake, ukubwa wa mifupa yake ukadhihirika kwake, naye alikuwa amefunga, basi saumu yake imevunjika.))"
"626","[AI-translation] ((Mtu anayefunga wakati wa Ramadhani hali ya kusafiri ni kama yule asiyefunga hali ya kukaa [yaani katika hali ya ukaazi].))"
"627","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekufa hali ana deni la saumu, basi kwa kila siku, masikini alishwe kwa niaba yake.))"
"628","[AI-translation] ((Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikataza kufunga Siku ya Arafa katika uwanda wa Arafat.))"
"629","[AI-translation] ((Fungeni siku ya Ashura [tarehe 10 ya Muharram], na kwa kupingana na Mayahudi, fungeni pia siku moja kabla yake au siku moja baada yake.))"
"630","[AI-translation] ((Mamoola ni ndege wa kwanza aliyeshika saumu ya Ashura.))"
"631","[AI-translation] ((Yule mkarimu kwa familia yake siku ya Ashura, Allah Mtukufu atampa wingi mwaka mzima.))"
"632","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyekesha usiku mmoja wa Rajab [kwa ibada] na akafunga siku moja, Allah Mtukufu atamlisha matunda ya Pepo.))"
"633","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayefunga siku tatu katika Rajab, Allah Mtukufu humwandikia ujira wa kufunga mwezi mzima.))"
"634","[AI-translation] ((Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) aliulizwa: Saumu gani ni bora zaidi baada ya Ramadhani? Akajibu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam): Zile za mwezi wa Sha'ban.))"
"635","[AI-translation] ((Siku ya kwanza ya saumu miongoni mwa Siku Nyeupe [yaani tarehe 13, 14, na 15 ya mwezi] ni sawa na miaka elfu tatu, siku ya pili ni sawa na miaka elfu kumi, na siku ya tatu ni sawa na miaka elfu kumi na tatu.))"
"636","[AI-translation] ((Mtu akifunga saumu ya hiari, hata akipewa dhahabu sawa na ardhi kama malipo, ujira wake bado haujatolewa kikamilifu.))"
"637","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyefunga saumu ya hiari wala hakuna aliyejua kuhusu hilo, Allah Mtukufu atamridhisha kwa kumruzuku kisichopungua Pepo.))"
"638","[AI-translation] ((Mfungaji yuko [kila wakati] katika ibada, hata akilala kitandani mwake.))"
"639","[AI-translation] ((Hijja na Umra zote ni faradhi.))"
"640","[AI-translation] ((Ukifanya Umra, ni bora kwako.))"
"641","[AI-translation] ((Hijja, Jihad, na Umra ni matendo ya hiari.))"
"642","[AI-translation] ((Yule mwenye uwezo wa safari ya Nyumba ya Allah, ukiwemo gharama za safari na kipando, lakini hafanyi Hijja, basi haijalishi akifa kama Myahudi au Mkristo.))"
"643","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyeoa kabla ya kufanya Hijja ameanza dhambi na uasi.))"
"644","[AI-translation] ((Hiji anapotoka nyumbani kwake, yuko chini ya ulinzi wa Allah. Akifa kabla ya kukamilisha ibada za Hijja, Allah humghfiria dhambi zake zilizotangulia.))"
"645","[AI-translation] ((Lau watu wangejua fadhila ambayo mahujaji wanao juu yao, wangekuja kwao hata kwa kuosha miguu yao.))"
"646","[AI-translation] ((Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) aliweka 'Aqiq kuwa miqat kwa watu wa Mashariki.))"
"647","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayevaa Ihram kwa Hijja au Umra kutoka Masjid Al-Aqsa na kuelekea Masjid Al-Haram, dhambi zake zote zilizotangulia na zijazo zitaghfiriwa, au Pepo itakuwa wajibu kwake.))"
"648","[AI-translation] ((Ka'b bin Ujrah (Allah amridhie) alipokuwa na maumivu kichwani mwake, alinyoa kichwa chake. Baada ya hili, Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alimamrisha achinje ng'ombe.))"
"649","[AI-translation] ((Tulihiji na Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam), na wanawake na watoto walikuwa nasi. Basi tulisoma Talbiya kwa niaba ya watoto na pia tukawafanyia Rami.))"
"650","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipomaliza kusoma Talbiya, alimuomba Allah radhi yake na Pepo, na akajikinga na Moto wa Jahannamu kwa rehma ya Allah.))"
"651","[AI-translation] ((Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipouona Nyumba ya Allah, aliinua mikono yake miwili na akaomba dua hii ((Ee Allah, iongezee Nyumba hii heshima na utukufu na ukarimu na hiba, na umwongezee yule anayeitukuza na kuikarimu miongoni mwa wale walioihiji na kuifanyia umra heshima na utukufu na ukarimu na wema)).))"
"652","[AI-translation] ((Nyumba ya Allah ina Bwana anayeilinda.))"
"653","[AI-translation] ((Allah Mtukufu ameahidi kuhusu Nyumba hii [yaani Kaaba] kwamba kila mwaka [angalau] watu laki sita wataihiji.))"
"654","[AI-translation] ((Allah Mtukufu amesema: Ninapokusudia kuiharibu dunia, kwanza nitaiharibu Nyumba yangu, kisha baada ya hapo, nitaiharibu dunia.))"
"655","[AI-translation] ((Malaika elfu sabini wamewekwa kwenye Rukn Yamani, basi yule anayesema [maandishi ya Kiarabu], malaika wote watasema Amin. Na yule anayefanya Tawafu ya Kaaba na kusema maneno haya tu [maandishi ya Kiarabu], dhambi zake kumi zitafutwa, mema kumi yataandikiwa kwake, na cheo chake kitainuliwa kwa daraja kumi.))"
"656","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayefanya Tawafu kwa wiki mvua inanyesha, dhambi zake zilizotangulia zitaghfiriwa.))"
"657","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayetawadha vizuri na kutembea baina ya Safa na Marwa, Allah Mtukufu humwandikia daraja elfu sabini kwa kila hatua.))"
"658","[AI-translation] ((Maji ya Zamzam na moto wa Jahannamu kamwe hauwezi kuchanganyika tumboni mwa mja yoyote.))"
"659","[AI-translation] ((Hakika kwa hiji anayepanda, kuna mema 70 kwa kila hatua ya kipando chake, na kwa yule anayetembea, kuna mema 700 kwa kila hatua.))"
"660","[AI-translation] ((Katika ukamilifu wa Hijja, kuchinja ngamia pia kumojumuishwa.))"
"661","[AI-translation] ((Katika ukamilifu wa Hijja, pia kumojumuishwa kwamba uvae Ihram kutoka eneo la familia yako na wategemezi.))"
"662","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayefanya Hijja kwa niaba ya umma wangu ni kama mama wa Musa (amani iwe juu yake), ambaye alikuwa akimnyonyesha na pia akipokea malipo kwa hilo kutoka kwa Firauni.))"
"663","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekufa njiani kuelekea Makka hali ya kufanya Hijja, Allah Mtukufu hatamkabili wala hatachukua hisabu yake.))"
"664","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekufa katika mojawapo ya Haram mbili, uombezi wangu huwa wajibu kwake.))"
"665","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyeita Madina 'Yathrib' aombe maghfira kutoka kwa Allah mara tatu.))"
"666","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayeswali swala arobaini mfululizo katika msikiti wangu, bila kukosa swala yoyote, ataandikiwa uhuru kutokana na Moto, wokovu kutokana na adhabu, na uhuru kutokana na unafiki.))"
"667","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayenizuru Madina kwa nia ya thawabu, nitakuwa shahidi na mwombezi kwake Siku ya Kiama.))"
"668","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayenizuru kwa makusudi atakuwa chini ya ulinzi wangu Siku ya Hukumu.))"
"669","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayenizuru mimi na baba yangu Ibrahim (amani iwe juu yake) katika mwaka mmoja ataingia Peponi.))"
"670","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyefanya Hijja [iliyoamrishwa] ya Uislamu, akazuru kaburi langu, akashiriki katika vita, na akanisomea salawat baada ya kufika Bayt al-Maqdis, basi Allah Mtukufu hatamuuliza kuhusu faradhi.))"
"671","[AI-translation] ((Yule mwenye uwezo wala hanijii [yaani kuzuru kaburi langu], basi amenidhulumu.))"
"672","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyefanya Hijja kwa niaba ya wazazi wake au akalipa deni lao, Allah Mtukufu atamfufua Siku ya Kiama miongoni mwa wenye haki.))"
"673","[AI-translation] ((Magonjwa ni zawadi kutoka kwa Allah kwa mja, basi miongoni mwa waja, mpendwa zaidi kwa Allah ni yule anayepokea zawadi nyingi zaidi.))"
"674","[AI-translation] ((Ugonjwa hushuka mara moja, lakini afya hushuka kidogo kidogo.))"
"675","[AI-translation] ((Msiba na dhiki vitaifanya nyuso za wenye mitihani kuwa nyeupe siku ambayo nyuso zitatiwa weusi.))"
"676","[AI-translation] ((Kama katika dunia hii Allah akichukua macho ya mtu, basi ni haki juu ya Allah kwamba macho yake hayataona moto wa Jahannamu.))"
"677","[AI-translation] ((Mtu anapobaki mgonjwa kwa siku tatu, huwa huru kutokana na dhambi kana kwamba siku hiyo mama yake alimzaa.))"
"678","[AI-translation] ((Msijifanye wagonjwa, mtakuwa wagonjwa; wala msichimbe makaburi yenu, mtakufa.))"
"679","[AI-translation] ((Dua za watu watano zinakubaliwa: dua ya aliyedhulumiwa hadi apate kisasi; dua ya hiji hadi arudi [nyumbani]; dua ya mpiganaji hadi aketi miongoni mwa familia yake; dua ya mgonjwa hadi apone; na dua ya ndugu kwa ndugu yake kwa ghaibu. Kisha Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akasema: Miongoni mwa dua hizi zote, ile inayokubaliwa haraka zaidi ni dua ya ndugu kwa ndugu yake kwa ghaibu.))"
"680","[AI-translation] ((Watembeleeni wagonjwa na waombeni wakuombeeni dua, kwani dua ya mgonjwa inakubaliwa na dhambi zao hughfiriwa.))"
"681","[AI-translation] ((Mmoja wenu anapokuwa na mgonjwa anayetamani chakula fulani, basi amlishe.))"
"682","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayetawadha na kutawadha vizuri, kisha akamtembelea ndugu yake Muislamu kwa nia ya thawabu, atawekwa mbali na Jahannamu kwa umbali wa miaka sabini [70].))"
"683","[AI-translation] ((Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akiwatembelea wagonjwa [kwa kuuliza] siku tatu baada ya kuanza kwa ugonjwa.))"
"684","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayemtembelea mgonjwa na kukaa naye kwa muda, Allah Mtukufu humpa ujira wa miaka elfu.))"
"685","[AI-translation] ((Kwa mtazamo wangu, kumtembelea mgonjwa kunapendwa zaidi kuliko ibada ya miaka arobaini au hamsini.))"
"686","[AI-translation] ((Msipuuzie kuwatembelea wagonjwa.))"
"687","[AI-translation] ((Msiwatembelee aina tatu za wagonjwa: mwenye ugonjwa wa jicho, mwenye maumivu ya jino, na mwenye jipu.))"
"688","[AI-translation] ((Msimtembelee yule asiyewatembelea mnapokuwa wagonjwa.))"
"689","[AI-translation] ((Mnapomtembelea mgonjwa, mpeni matumaini kuhusu kifo chake, kwani hakika matumaini haya hayaepushi chochote, lakini huyafurahisha moyo wa mgonjwa.))"
"690","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekufa katika hali ya ugonjwa amekufa kifo cha shahidi.))"
"691","[AI-translation] ((Kifo cha msafiri ni ushuhuda.))"
"692","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akijikinga kutokana na aina saba za kifo: kifo cha ghafla, kuumwa na nyoka, kushambuliwa na mnyama wa porini, kuzama, kuungua, kuangukia kitu au kitu kikuangukie, na kuuawa hali ya kukimbia wakati wa vita.))"
"693","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akijikinga kutokana na kifo cha ghafla na akipenda kuwa mgonjwa kabla ya kifo.))"
"694","[AI-translation] ((Kifo peke yake kinatosha kama mhubiri.))"
"695","[AI-translation] ((Mwenye kunyimwa ni yule aliyenyimwa kiini.))"
"696","[AI-translation] ((Waamrisheni wanaokufa wenu kusema maneno haya, [maandishi ya Kiarabu].))"
"697","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekufa Bayt al-Maqdis, ni kana kwamba amekufa mbinguni.))"
"698","[AI-translation] ((Lau tone moja la uchungu wa kifo lingewekwa juu ya milima yote ya ardhi, ingeyeyuka.))"
"699","[AI-translation] ((Roho ya muumini inapoondoka, malaika wa rehma huichukua na kusema: Mwacheni apumzike, kwani alivumilia dhiki nyingi duniani.))"
"700","[AI-translation] ((Kifo ni kafara kwa kila Muislamu.))"
"701","[AI-translation] ((Kifo ni kafara kwa muumini.))"
"702","[AI-translation] ((Someni Sura Yasin karibu na maiti zenu.))"
"703","[AI-translation] ((Juu ya maiti ambaye Sura Yasin inasomwa, Allah Mtukufu humpa wepesi.))"
"704","[AI-translation] ((Matendo yenu huonyeshwa kwa jamaa zenu waliokufa; matendo yakikuwa mema, hufurahi, na yakisiwa mema, huomba: Ee Allah! Usiwafishe hadi uwaongoze kama ulivyotuongoza sisi.))"
"705","[AI-translation] ((Msiwaaibishe maiti zenu kwa sababu ya matendo yenu mabaya, kwani matendo yenu huonyeshwa kwa marafiki zenu waliomo makaburini.))"
"706","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayesoma ((Hakika sisi ni wa Allah na hakika sisi kwake tutarejea)) wakati wa msiba, Allah Mtukufu humfidia hasara yake, humpa matokeo mema, na humpa badala yake kitu anachokipenda.))"
"707","[AI-translation] ((Umma wangu umepewa, wakati wa msiba [kusema], kitu ambacho hakuna umma [mwingine] uliopewa [nayo ni] ((Hakika sisi ni wa Allah na hakika sisi kwake tutarejea)).))"
"708","[AI-translation] ((Kwa sababu ya kilio cha walio hai, maji ya moto hunyunyiziwa maiti.))"
"709","[AI-translation] (([Ee Ali!] Usichelewe katika mambo matatu [mojawapo ni] jeneza linapokuwepo [basi katika kulipeleka kuzikwa].))"
"710","[AI-translation] ((Si halali kuuweka mwili wa maiti wa Muislamu miongoni mwa wanafamilia yake.))"
"711","[AI-translation] ((Watendeeni wanaume wenu kama mnavyowatendea mabibi-arusi.))"
"712","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayemwosha maiti huwa huru kutokana na dhambi kana kwamba siku mama yake alimzaa.))"
"713","[AI-translation] ((Mwanamke akifa miongoni mwa wanaume wala hakuna mwanamke mwingine, au mwanamume akifa miongoni mwa wanawake wala hakuna mwanamume mwingine, basi wafanyiwe tayammum na wazikwe, na wote watakuwa kama mtu asiye na maji.))"
"714","[AI-translation] ((Fatimah (Allah amridhie) alijiogesha na akavaa sanda kabla ya kifo chake. Ali (Allah amridhie) aliridhika na hili.))"
"715","[AI-translation] ((Waogesheni waliouawa wenu [mashahidi].))"
"716","[AI-translation] ((Msifunue paja lenu, wala msiangalie paja la mtu yoyote, awe hai au maiti.))"
"717","[AI-translation] ((Msitoe sanda za gharama kubwa kwa sababu huchakaa haraka sana.))"
"718","[AI-translation] ((Wapeni maiti zenu sanda nzuri kwa sababu hutembeleana makaburini.))"
"719","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alisandwa katika mavazi saba.))"
"720","[AI-translation] ((Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) aliona jeneza, na watu walikuwa wakilibeba haraka, basi [Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam] akasema: Mnapaswa kuwa watulivu na wastahimilivu.))"
"721","[AI-translation] (([Mtume wa Allah, Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam, aliulizwa kuhusu kutembea na jeneza, basi [Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam] akajibu:] Mwendo ambao ni chini ya kukimbia.))"
"722","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayehudhuria jeneza abebe [jeneza la maiti] kutoka pande zote nne.))"
"723","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayelibeba jeneza kutoka pande zote nne, Allah Mtukufu humghfiria dhambi zake kubwa arobaini.))"
"724","[AI-translation] ((Wapeni wanaokufa wenu riziki ya Kalima ((Hapana mungu isipokuwa Allah)).))"
"725","[AI-translation] ((Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipotembea nyuma ya jeneza, ni msemo huu tu ((Hapana mungu isipokuwa Allah)) ndio uliosikika kutoka kwake.))"
"726","[AI-translation] ((Baada ya kifo cha mja [muumini], thawabu ya kwanza kabisa anayopewa ni kwamba wote wanaotembea nyuma ya jeneza lake hughfiriwa.))"
"727","[AI-translation] ((Heshima ya muumini kwa Allah ni kwamba huwaghfiria wale wanaotembea na jeneza lake.))"
"728","[AI-translation] ((Je, hamwoni haya kwamba malaika wa Allah wanatembea kwa miguu ilhali ninyi mnapanda?))"
"729","[AI-translation] ((Msitembee mbele ya jeneza [msafara].))"
"730","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akitembea nyuma ya msafara wa jeneza.))"
"731","[AI-translation] (([Mtume wa Allah, Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam, alikuwa akihudhuria jeneza wakati Umar (Allah amridhie) aliposhtuka alipomwona mwanamke. Basi Mtume, Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam, akasema:] Ee Umar! Mwache.))"
"732","[AI-translation] ((Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) mara moja alitoka nyumbani kwake na akawaona wanawake wamekaa njiani. Akauliza: Kwanini mmekaa hapa? Wakajibu: Tunasubiri jeneza. Aliposikia hili, aliwakemea na akawaamrisha warudi.))"
"733","[AI-translation] ((Hakuna kheri katika jamaa ya wanawake isipokuwa msikitini au kwa jeneza la mtu aliyeuawa.))"
"734","[AI-translation] ((Hakuna thawabu kwa wanawake katika kufuata msafara wa jeneza.))"
"735","[AI-translation] ((Yule ambaye, anapoona jeneza, husema: ((Allah ni Mkubwa, Allah na Mtume wake wamesema kweli, hii ndiyo aliyotuahidi Allah na Mtume wake, ee Allah tuongezee imani na kujisalimisha)), mema ishirini huandikiwa kwake kila siku kutoka siku hiyo hadi Siku ya Kiama.))"
"736","[AI-translation] ((Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) na Abu Bakr na Umar (Allah awaridhie) hawakutufanya halali chochote kama walivyotufanya halali katika swala ya jeneza kwa maiti, yaani hawakuweka wakati maalum kwa hilo.))"
"737","[AI-translation] ((Wasalieni jeneza watoto wenu.))"
"738","[AI-translation] ((Swala ya jeneza ya mtoto haitosaliwa.))"
"739","[AI-translation] ((Mtoto njiti anapolia, swala yake ya jeneza itasaliwa naye pia atafanywa mrithi.))"
"740","[AI-translation] ((Takbira za [swala ya jeneza] za mwisho ambazo Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alisema zilikuwa nne.))"
"741","[AI-translation] ((Malaika waliswali swala ya jeneza ya Adam (amani iwe juu yake) na wakasema takbira nne.))"
"742","[AI-translation] ((Tumeamrishwa kusoma Sura Al-Fatiha juu ya maiti zetu.))"
"743","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyeswali swala ya jeneza msikitini, hakuna chochote [thawabu] kwake.))"
"744","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekufa kwa kuzama aachwe kwa siku moja na usiku, kisha azikwe.))"
"745","[AI-translation] ((Zikeni maiti zenu miongoni mwa watu wema, kwani maiti pia huhisi dhiki kutokana na jirani mbaya kama mtu aliye hai anavyohisi dhiki kutokana na jirani mbaya.))"
"746","[AI-translation] ((Kila nyumba ina mlango, na mlango wa kaburi uko miguuni mwake.))"
"747","[AI-translation] ((Mwanamke ana pazia mbili: kaburi na mumewe.))"
"748","[AI-translation] ((Adhabu ya kaburi ni kweli, na yule asiyeamini humo ataadhibiwa humo.))"
"749","[AI-translation] ((Maji yalinyunyizwa juu ya kaburi la Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam). Bilal (Allah amridhie) alinyunyiza maji kutoka kiriba juu ya kaburi la Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam). Alianza kunyunyiza kutoka upande wa kichwa na akaendelea kunyunyiza maji hadi upande wa miguu.))"
"750","[AI-translation] ((Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alinyunyiza maji juu ya kaburi la mwanawe Ibrahim na akaweka kokoto juu yake.))"
"751","[AI-translation] ((Kukaa kwa muda mrefu kwa umma wangu makaburini ni njia ya utakaso wa dhambi zao.))"
"752","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayemliwaza mtu aliyepatwa na msiba atapata ujira kama ule wa aliyepatwa.))"
"753","[AI-translation] ((Msionyeshe furaha juu ya msiba wa ndugu yenu; Allah Mtukufu atamrehemu naye atakuujaribu.))"
"754","[AI-translation] ((Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) aliwalaani wanawake wanaotembelea makaburi.))"
"755","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayezuru kaburi la mama yake, ni kana kwamba amefanya Umra.))"
"756","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayewasalimia maiti, watamjibu Siku ya Kiama.))"
"757","[AI-translation] ((Dhambi ya kuvunja mfupa wa maiti ni kama kuvunja mfupa wa mtu aliye hai.))"
"758","[AI-translation] (([Abu Razin alipouliza, Mtume wa Allah, Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam, alimfundisha dua hii ya kusoma anapopita makaburini mwa watu ((Amani iwe juu yenu, enyi wakaazi wa makaburi)): Amani iwe juu yenu, enyi wakaazi wa makaburi! Basi akasema: Ee Mtume wa Allah! Je, wanasikia? Mtume, Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam, akajibu: Wanasikia, lakini hawana uwezo wa kujibu.))"
"759","[AI-translation] ((Hakika Allah Mtukufu huteremsha rehma juu ya wakaazi wa makaburi, kubwa kama milima, kwa sababu ya dua ya watu wa ardhi.))"
"760","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyejiepusha na ndoa kwa kuogopa umasikini si miongoni mwetu.))"
"761","[AI-translation] ((Yule mwenye uwezo wa kuoa wala hao, hana uhusiano nami.))"
"762","[AI-translation] ((Msaidizi na msaidizi bora katika mambo ya dini ni mke mwema.))"
"763","[AI-translation] ((Baada ya kumcha Allah, faida bora kwa mwanaume muumini ni mke mwema.))"
"764","[AI-translation] ((Je, nisiwaarifu kuhusu hazina bora ya mtu? [Nayo ni] mke mwema.))"
"765","[AI-translation] ((Watu wenu wasiooa ni wabaya zaidi.))"
"766","[AI-translation] ((Hata kama siku moja ya uhai wangu inabaki, bado nitakutana na mke wangu kwa ajili ya Allah Mtukufu [Abu Hurairah (Allah amridhie)].))"
"767","[AI-translation] ((Rakaa mbili za mtu aliyeoa ni bora kuliko rakaa sabini za mtu asiyeoa.))"
"768","[AI-translation] ((Asiyeoa ni hati ya moto wa Jahannamu.))"
"769","[AI-translation] ((Mbedui alimlalamikia Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) kuhusu tamaa na njaa, basi [Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam] alimwamrisha: Mwoe mwanamke wa kwanza umpataye asiye na mume.))"
"770","[AI-translation] ((Mmoja wenu anapotaka kumwoa mwanamke, kama anavyouliza kuhusu uso wake, pia aulize kuhusu nywele zake, kwani nywele pia ni sehemu ya uzuri.))"
"771","[AI-translation] ((Waarabu wanafaa kuchumbiana.))"
"772","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayetaka kumkuta Allah katika hali ya twahara aoe wanawake huru.))"
"773","[AI-translation] ((Wanawake huru ni njia ya unyofu wa kaya, na watumwa wa kike ni njia ya uharibifu wa kaya.))"
"774","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayemwozesha binti yake kwa mfasiki [mtenda maovu, mwenye uasi], hakika amekata uhusiano naye.))"
"775","[AI-translation] ((Msioe wanawake kwa msingi wa undugu peke yake, kwani jambo hili lenyewe [baadaye] huwa sababu ya kukata uhusiano.))"
"776","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayemwoa mwanamke kwa heshima yake, Allah humwongezea tu dhalili; yule anayemwoa kwa mali yake, Allah humwongezea tu umasikini; yule anayemwoa kwa uzuri wake, Allah humwongezea tu uduni; na yule anayeoa kwa ajili ya kuinamisha macho yake, kulinda sehemu zake za siri, au kuunganisha uhusiano wa undugu, Allah huweka baraka kwake katika mwanamke na kwa mwanamke humo.))"
"777","[AI-translation] ((Msioe wanawake kwa uzuri wao, kwani inawezekana uzuri wao ukawapelekea maangamizi, wala msiwaoe kwa mali yao, kwani inawezekana mali yao ikawafanya waasi. Bali waoweni kwa msingi wa dini, na hakika mtumwa mweusi wa kidini mwenye pua iliyotobolewa na kukatwa ni bora kuliko mwanamke mzuri na tajiri asiye na dini.))"
"778","[AI-translation] ((Msimwoe mwanamke mpumbavu, kwani ukaribu naye ni mitihani na kuna madhara katika watoto wake.))"
"779","[AI-translation] ((Chagueni [wanawake] kwa uangalifu kwa ajili ya watoto wenu, kwa sababu wanawake huzaa watoto wanaofanana na ndugu zao wa kiume na wa kike.))"
"780","[AI-translation] ((Washauri wanawake kuhusu binti zao [kwa sababu wanajua vizuri hali ya kiakili na kimaadili ya binti zao, kwa hiyo wanaweza kukuambia kama mtaweza kupatana nao au la].))"
"781","[AI-translation] ((Umm Salamah na Maymunah (Allah awaridhie) walikuwa na Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) wakati ghafla Ibn Umm Maktum (Allah amridhie) alikuja kwake. Baada ya hili, Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akasema: Nyote wawili jificheni kwake. Umm Salamah (Allah amridhie) akasema: Ee Mtume wa Allah! Mtu huyu ni kipofu; hatuoni. Basi Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akasema: Je, nyote wawili pia ni vipofu? Je, hammwoni?))"
"782","[AI-translation] ((Mapenzi ya kwanza ya Uislamu ni mapenzi ya Mtume Muhammad (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) kwa Aisha (Allah amridhie).))"
"783","[AI-translation] ((Mahari [mahr] si chini ya dirhamu kumi.))"
"784","[AI-translation] ((Mwanamke bora miongoni mwenu ni yule ambaye mahari yake ni nyepesi [yaani kwa sababu mahari yake ni ndogo, malipo yake ni nyepesi].))"
"785","[AI-translation] ((Mwanamke mwenye baraka zaidi ni yule ambaye gharama zake [yaani mahari na kadhalika] ni ndogo zaidi.))"
"786","[AI-translation] ((Tangazeni ndoa, ifanyeni misikitini, na pigengesheni dufu humo.))"
"787","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipomwoa mwanamke, watu walitawanya tende za Ajwa juu ya kichwa chake.))"
"788","[AI-translation] ((Ujanja, hila, na udanganyifu huruhusiwa tu katika ndoa.))"
"789","[AI-translation] ((Wanawake hao ni wazinifu wanaojiozesha bila mashahidi.))"
"790","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayemwoa mwanamke ampe zawadi kabla ya kumkaribia, hata kama ni kiatu kimoja tu miongoni mwa viatu vyake.))"
"791","[AI-translation] ((Mmoja wenu anapojamiiana, asiangalie kuelekea sehemu za siri, kwa sababu hii husababisha upofu.))"
"792","[AI-translation] Bibi Aisha (Allah amridhie) alisema: Sikuwahi kuona sehemu za siri za Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam)."
"793","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayeangalia sehemu ya siri ya mwanamke, basi mama yake na binti yake hawabaki halali kwake [yaani sasa hawezi kumwoa yeyote miongoni mwao].))"
"794","[AI-translation] ((Mmoja wenu asizungumze kupita kiasi wakati wa kujamiiana, kwa sababu hii inaweza kusababisha mtoto kuzaliwa bubu.))"
"795","[AI-translation] ((Ni wajibu kwa mwanaume kujipamba kwa mkewe kama ilivyo wajibu kwa mwanamke kwake.))"
"796","[AI-translation] ((Nimekataza tu kupora ghanima za vita, si kushiriki katika karamu za arusi.))"
"797","[AI-translation] ((Tamaa ya wanawake ni mara mbili ya ya wanaume.))"
"798","[AI-translation] ((Si halali kwa mwanamke yoyote anayeamini Allah na Siku ya Mwisho kufunua sehemu yoyote ya nywele zake au kifua mbele ya Myahudi, Mkristo, au Majusi, na yule anayefanya hivyo hana uaminifu.))"
"799","[AI-translation] ((Mwanamke anayetoka nyumba ya mumewe bila idhini yake, kila kitu ambacho jua na mwezi huchomozea humlaani, isipokuwa mumewe aridhike naye.))"
"800","[AI-translation] ((Mwanamke asitoke nyumbani kwake bila idhini ya mumewe; akifanya hivyo, malaika wa mbinguni, malaika wa rehma, na malaika wa adhabu [wote] watamlaani hadi arudi.))"
"801","[AI-translation] ((Utii kwa wanawake huongoza kwenye majuto.))"
"802","[AI-translation] ((Yule mwenye subira na tabia mbaya ya mkewe, Allah Mtukufu atampa ujira sawa na ujira aliopewa Ayub (amani iwe juu yake) kwa mitihani yake. Na mwanamke yeyote mwenye subira na tabia mbaya ya mumewe, Allah Mtukufu atampa ujira sawa na ujira aliopewa Asiya (amani iwe juu yake), mke wa Firauni.))"
"803","[AI-translation] ((Msiwaweke [wanawake] katika vyumba vya juu, wala msiwafundishe kuandika na kusoma; wafundisheni kusokota uzi na wafundisheni Sura An-Nur.))"
"804","[AI-translation] ((Mtu mwenye heshima pekee ndiye anayewaonyesha heshima wanawake, na mtu duni pekee ndiye anayewadhalilisha.))"
"805","[AI-translation] ((Mtumwa wa mke ameangamia.))"
"806","[AI-translation] ((Shaurianeni nao [wanawake] lakini wapingeni.))"
"807","[AI-translation] ((Mmoja wenu asifanye kazi yoyote hadi ashauri, na kama hakuna wa kushauri, basi mshauri mwanamke, kisha upinge ushauri wake, kwa sababu kuna baraka katika kuupinga.))"
"808","[AI-translation] ((Ondoeni nguo za wanawake [ili] wabaki wamekaa katika sehemu yao ya kujitenga ndani ya nyumba.))"
"809","[AI-translation] ((Mfano wa mke mwema miongoni mwa wanawake ni kama ule wa kunguru mmoja miongoni mwa kunguru mia moja.))"
"810","[AI-translation] ((Jihad ya mwanamke ni kumtii mumewe [na kumtendea kwa tabia njema].))"
"811","[AI-translation] ((Mwanamke akifa ilhali mumewe ameridhika naye, ataingia Peponi.))"
"812","[AI-translation] ((Mjane mcha Mungu amepewa cheo cha shahidi [shaheeda] mbinguni.))"
"813","[AI-translation] ((Sipendi wanaume ambao ni waonja wala wanawake ambao ni waonja. [Imam Ibn Athir (Allah amrehemu) alielezea maana yake kama wale wenye haraka katika ndoa na pia wenye haraka katika talaka.] ))"
"814","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayeenda kupanga ndoa ya watu wawili, Allah Mtukufu atampa ujira wa mwaka mmoja kwa kila hatua na kila neno, na yule anayeenda kuwatenganisha watu wawili, ni wajibu kwa Allah Mtukufu kuupiga kichwa chake kwenye miamba elfu Jahannamu Siku ya Hukumu.))"
"815","[AI-translation] ((Ee Mu'adh! Allah Mtukufu hakuumba chochote juu ya uso wa ardhi ambacho kinapendwa zaidi kwake kuliko kuwaacha huru [watumwa], na Allah Mtukufu hakuumba chochote juu ya uso wa ardhi ambacho kinachukiwa zaidi kwake kuliko talaka.))"
"816","[AI-translation] ((Mjakazi ana talaka mbili na eda yake ni hedhi mbili.))"
"817","[AI-translation] ((Haki ya kunyonyesha [yule anayenyonyesha] itimizwe vipi?)) Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akasema: ((Kwa kutoa mtumwa wa kiume au mtumwa wa kike kama malipo.))"
"818","[AI-translation] ((Msimwachie mwanamke mpumbavu awanyonyeshe watoto wenu.))"
"819","[AI-translation] ((Hakuna li'an baina ya aina nne za watu: baina ya mtu huru na mjakazi, baina ya mwanamke huru na mtumwa wa kiume, baina ya mwanaume Muislamu na mwanamke Myahudi, na baina ya mwanaume Muislamu na mwanamke Mkristo.))"
"820","[AI-translation] ((Oeni na zaeni watoto, kwani Siku ya Hukumu nataka kujivunia [wingi wenu] mbele ya mataifa mengine.))"
"821","[AI-translation] ((Mwana ni siri ya baba yake.))"
"822","[AI-translation] ((Siku ambayo Hasan bin Ali (Allah awaridhie) alizaliwa, Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alimuadhini sikio lake la kuume na akamsomea iqama sikio lake la kushoto.))"
"823","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayemtaja [mtoto wake] kwa jina langu asichukue kunya yangu, na yule anayechukua kunya yangu asimtaje [mtoto wake] kwa jina langu.))"
"824","[AI-translation] ((Hakika Siku ya Kiama mtaitwa kwa majina yenu na majina ya baba zenu, basi jiwekeeni majina mema.))"
"825","[AI-translation] ((Tohara ni Sunna kwa wanaume na jambo la heshima kwa wanawake.))"
"826","[AI-translation] ((Mtu asiyetahiriwa hatavumiliwa katika Uislamu hadi atahiriwe, hata kama ana miaka themanini.))"
"827","[AI-translation] ((Mtu asiyetahiriwa hawezi kufanya Hijja ya Nyumba ya Allah hadi atahiriwe.))"
"828","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alizaliwa ametahiriwa.))"
"829","[AI-translation] ((Yule Muislamu afanye tohara, hata kama ana umri mkubwa.))"
"830","[AI-translation] ((Wafundisheni wana wenu kuogelea na kurusha mishale.))"
"831","[AI-translation] ((Ni bora kwa mtu kufundisha tabia njema kwa watoto wake kuliko kutoa saa moja [takriban kilo mbili na nusu ya nafaka] sadaka.))"
"832","[AI-translation] ((Baba hajampa mtoto wake zawadi yoyote bora kuliko tabia njema.))"
"833","[AI-translation] ((Mtoto ana haki juu ya baba kwamba ampe jina jema na amfundishe tabia njema.))"
"834","[AI-translation] ((Msiwapige watoto wenu kwa kulia.))"
"835","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyeweka mkono wake kwa rehma na huruma juu ya kichwa cha yatima, kwa kila unywele ambao mkono wake umepita juu yake, kuna jema kwake kama thawabu.))"
"836","[AI-translation] ((Mtu alilalamika kuwa na watoto wachache, basi Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alimwamrisha ale mayai na vitunguu.))"
"837","[AI-translation] ((Wapendeni watoto wa kike, kwani mimi pia ni baba wa watoto wa kike.))"
"838","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayetumia dirhamu kwa ndoa ya mwanawe au binti yake, Allah Mtukufu atampa miji kumi na miwili Peponi kwa kila dirhamu iliyotumika.))"
"839","[AI-translation] ((Tone la maji ambalo mtoto huumbwa nalo husababisha viungo vyote na mishipa kutetemeka.))"
"840","[AI-translation] ((Idadi ndogo ya wanafamilia ni wepesi; wingi wao ni umasikini.))"
"841","[AI-translation] ((Wapeni watoto wenu kunya kabla majina ya utani hayajaenea juu yao.))"
"842","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyemlea mtoto hadi akaanza kusema Kalima 'La ilaha illallah', Allah Mtukufu hatachukua hisabu kwake.))"
"843","[AI-translation] ((Allah amrehemu baba anayemsaidia mtoto wake katika kufanya matendo mema.))"
"844","[AI-translation] ((Kuweni sawa miongoni mwa watoto wenu mnapotoa zawadi.))"
"845","[AI-translation] ((Dua ya baba kwa mtoto wake ni kama dua ya nabii kwa umma wake.))"
"846","[AI-translation] ((Wafanyieni wema wazazi wenu na wana wenu watawafanyia wema.))"
"847","[AI-translation] ((Wema kwa wazazi ni bora kuliko swala, saumu, Hijja, Umra, na kujitahidi katika njia ya Allah.))"
"848","[AI-translation] ((Harufu ya Pepo itasikika kutoka umbali wa miaka mia tano, lakini yule asiyewatii wazazi wake atanyimwa harufu yake.))"
"849","[AI-translation] ((Mtu anapoacha kuwaombea dua wazazi wake, riziki kutoka kwa watoto wao duniani hukatwa.))"
"850","[AI-translation] ((Kama nitawapata wazazi wangu au hata mmoja wao, nami ninafanya swala ya Isha, nikiwa nimeisoma Sura Al-Fatiha humo, nao wakaniita: Ee Muhammad! basi nitawajibu, nikisema: Nipo hapa.))"
"851","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyebusu baina ya macho ya mama yake, tendo hili litakuwa kizuizi kwake kutokana na moto wa Jahannamu.))"
"852","[AI-translation] ((Wakati wa kifo ulikuja kwa kijana; kwa sababu ya kumuasi mama yake, hakuweza kusoma Kalima. Kisha Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alimuombea kwa mama yake, na aliporidhika, ndipo aliweza kusoma Kalima.))"
"853","[AI-translation] ((Yule mtiifu kwa wazazi na Bwana atakuwa katika daraja za juu za 'Illiyyin.))"
"854","[AI-translation] ((Wazazi wa mtu au mmoja wao akifa naye alikuwa akiwaasi, lakini kisha akaendelea kuswali na kuomba maghfira kwao, huandikwa na Allah kama mwenye wema na utii.))"
"855","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayewaangalia wazazi wake kwa macho ya rehma, Allah Mtukufu humwandikia ujira wa Hijja iliyokubaliwa kwa kila macho kama hayo. Masahaba wakauliza: Hata akiangalia mara mia moja [100] kwa siku? Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akajibu: Ndiyo, Allah Mtukufu ni Mkubwa na Mtakatifu Zaidi.))"
"856","[AI-translation] ((Wao ni Pepo yenu [mkiwatii] na Jahannamu yenu [mkiwaasi].))"
"857","[AI-translation] ((Wakati halali na haramu zinapochanganyika, haramu hushinda.))"
"858","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekula kipande cha haramu, swala yake haikubaliwi kwa siku arobaini.))"
"859","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayeacha dirhamu moja ya haramu, Allah, Bwana wa Utukufu, atamwachilia huru kutokana na moto wa Jahannamu.))"
"860","[AI-translation] ((Yule asiye nyofu katika mambo ya riziki si nyofu katika mambo ya dini pia.))"
"861","[AI-translation] ((Allah Mtukufu humchukia kijana mvivu.))"
"862","[AI-translation] ((Allah Mtukufu humchukia mtu mvivu.))"
"863","[AI-translation] ((Mja wangu akiona haya ya halali, Allah Mtukufu humtia haramu.))"
"864","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayepata mali kwa njia haramu, Allah Mtukufu humwongoza kwenye maangamizi.))"
"865","[AI-translation] ((Malaika wa Allah Mtukufu yupo Bayt al-Maqdis, anayetangaza kila usiku kwamba yule aliyekula haramu, wala ibada yake yoyote ya hiari haitakubaliwa wala faradhi yoyote.))"
"866","[AI-translation] ((Lau watu wa Peponi wangefanya biashara, wangefanya biashara ya nguo.))"
"867","[AI-translation] ((Mfanyabiashara mwoga hunyimwa, na mfanyabiashara shujaa hupewa riziki.))"
"868","[AI-translation] ((Jifunzeni uandishi, kwani hakika ni ufunguo wa riziki.))"
"869","[AI-translation] ((Watu wabaya zaidi ni wafanyabiashara na wakulima.))"
"870","[AI-translation] ((Mali mbaya zaidi katika nyakati za mwisho zitakuwa watumwa na watumwa wa kike.))"
"871","[AI-translation] ((Wabahiri wa umma wangu ni washonaji.))"
"872","[AI-translation] ((Ee Allah! Usitukubalie maoni ya mfanyabiashara na msafiri miongoni mwetu, kwa sababu mfanyabiashara wetu hutamani bei kubwa na msafiri wetu huchukia mvua.))"
"873","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyetamani mfumuko wa bei kwa umma wangu hata kwa usiku mmoja, Allah Mtukufu ataharibu matendo yake ya miaka arobaini.))"
"874","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayeleta bidhaa sokoni hupewa riziki, na laana huombwa kwa yule anayehifidhi [bidhaa].))"
"875","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayehifidhi nafaka kwa siku arobaini atatengwa na Allah, na Allah atatengwa naye.))"
"876","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayehifidhi nafaka kwa Waislamu kwa siku arobaini, kisha hata akitoa yote sadaka, haitakuwa kafara kwake.))"
"877","[AI-translation] ((Kila mkopo unaoleta faida ni riba.))"
"878","[AI-translation] ((Hayaa huzuia riziki.))"
"879","[AI-translation] ((Kuosha vyombo na kusafisha ua [matendo yote mawili] humfanya mtu kustawi.))"
"880","[AI-translation] ((Mnaposwali swala ya Alfajiri, msilale [kwa uzembe] badala ya kutafuta riziki.))"
"881","[AI-translation] ((Kuna aina mbili ambazo Allah Mtukufu amewatukuza duniani na Akhera: moja ni dhahabu na nyingine ni fedha. Allah Mtukufu amezifanya chanzo cha heshima kwa watu wa dunia na chanzo cha pambo kwa watu wa Akhera.))"
"882","[AI-translation] ((Dirhamu imeitwa hivyo kwa sababu ni makao ya huzuni, na dinari imeitwa hivyo kwa sababu ni makao ya moto.))"
"883","[AI-translation] ((Allah Mtukufu aliumba riziki miaka elfu mbili kabla ya kuumbwa miili.))"
"884","[AI-translation] ((Msinunue samaki majini kwa sababu hii ni udanganyifu.))"
"885","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikataza kuuza kitu kilichoahirishwa kwa kingine kilichoahirishwa.))"
"886","[AI-translation] ((Yule alinunua kitu bila kukiona, kisha baada ya kukiona, ana chaguo [akikipenda, anaweza kukiweka, la sivyo anaweza kukirudisha].))"
"887","[AI-translation] ((Hakuna haki ya shuf'a kwa asiyekuwepo au kwa mtoto, na shuf'a ni kama kufungua kamba.))"
"888","[AI-translation] ((Allah Mtukufu anasema kwamba mimi ni wa tatu miongoni mwa washirika wawili maadamu mmoja wao hamsaliti mwenzake.))"
"889","[AI-translation] ((Kitu kilichowekwa rehani hakitazuiliwa kwa mwenye nacho; faida yake pia ni kwake, naye pia anawajibika kwa dhima yake.))"
"890","[AI-translation] ((Kuosha mikono kabla ya kula ni fadhila moja, ilhali kuosha mikono baada ya kula ni sababu ya fadhila mbili.))"
"891","[AI-translation] ((Kuosha mikono kabla ya kula huondoa umasikini na njaa.))"
"892","[AI-translation] ((Kuosha mikono kabla na baada ya kula ni njia ya wingi wa riziki na ya kuondoa njia za kishetani.))"
"893","[AI-translation] ((Baraka ya chakula iko katika kutawadha kabla na baada yake.))"
"894","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayesahau kusema Bismillah kabla ya kula asome Sura Al-Ikhlas [Qul Huwallahu Ahad] baada ya kumaliza.))"
"895","[AI-translation] ((Ee Ali! Hakikisha unatumia chumvi, kwani ni tiba ya magonjwa sabini, kama ukoma, barasi, na wazimu [n.k.].))"
"896","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayeanza mlo wake wa asubuhi kwa chumvi, Allah Mtukufu ataondoa aina sabini za magonjwa kwake.))"
"897","[AI-translation] ((Kiongozi wa viungo vyenu ni chumvi.))"
"898","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayeokota na kula kipande kinachoanguka kutoka kitambaa cha chakula au chombo [baada ya kukisafisha], huokolewa kutokana na umasikini, upumbavu, na ugonjwa wa ukoma.))"
"899","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekula kutoka chombo kisha akilamba, chombo humwombea maghfira.))"
"900","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipomaliza kula, alikuwa akisoma dua hii ((Sifa zote ni za Allah ambaye ametulisha na kutunywesha na akatufanya Waislamu)).))"
"901","[AI-translation] ((Mnapokula au kunywa kitu na kusoma dua hii ((Kwa jina la Allah ambaye pamoja na jina lake hakuna kinachodhuru ardhini wala mbinguni, ee Ulio Hai, ee Msimamizi)), basi hakuna ugonjwa utakaokupata kutoka chakula hicho, hata kama kina sumu.))"
"902","[AI-translation] ((Chakula sokoni ni uduni.))"
"903","[AI-translation] ((Heshimuni mkate, kwani Allah Mtukufu ameteremsha baraka za mbinguni kwa ajili yake na ametoa baraka za ardhi kwa ajili yake.))"
"904","[AI-translation] ((Heshimuni mkate kwa sababu Allah Mtukufu pia huuheshimu, na yule anayeheshimu mkate, Allah Mtukufu pia atamheshimu.))"
"905","[AI-translation] ((Taifa lolote linaloona haki ya mkate kuwa ndogo, Allah Mtukufu hulitia njaa.))"
"906","[AI-translation] ((Msikate mkate kwa kisu kama wasio Waarabu wanavyofanya.))"
"907","[AI-translation] ((Ufanye mkate mdogo na uongeze idadi yake; baraka itawekwa humo kwenu.))"
"908","[AI-translation] ((Ee Allah! Tunufaishie kupitia Uislamu na mkate; lau kama hangekuwepo mkate, tusingefunga, wala kusingeswali, wala kusingefanya Hijja, wala kusingejitahidi katika Jihad.))"
"909","[AI-translation] ((Milo mitatu haitahesabiwa kwa mtu: mlo wa kabla ya alfajiri [suhoor], mlo ambao mtu hufuturu nao [iftar], na mlo unaoliwa pamoja na ndugu.))"
"910","[AI-translation] ((Kupuliza chakula huondoa baraka.))"
"911","[AI-translation] ((Wale wanaolala usiku na matumbo yaliyojaa wana tabia njema, na wale wanaolala usiku na njaa wana tabia mbaya.))"
"912","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akikula asubuhi, hangekula jioni, na akikula jioni, hangekula asubuhi.))"
"913","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipokula chakula, alimhimidi Allah kisha akasoma dua hii ((Ee Allah, tubarikie humo na utulishe kilicho bora kuliko hicho)).))"
"914","[AI-translation] ((Mkuu wa chakula cha watu wa dunia na watu wa Pepo ni nyama.))"
"915","[AI-translation] ((Hakika moyo huhisi furaha na furaha wakati wa kula nyama.))"
"916","[AI-translation] ((Nyama huzalisha [hulisha] nyama, na yule anayejiepusha na nyama kwa siku arobaini, umbo lake [muonekano na sura] huwa mbaya.))"
"917","[AI-translation] ((Kuleni zeituni na pakeni mafuta yake, kwani ni safi na yenye baraka.))"
"918","[AI-translation] ((Kunywa maziwa ni imani safi; yule anayekunywa maziwa ndotoni yuko juu ya imani na maumbile.))"
"919","[AI-translation] ((Ni alama ya unyenyekevu kwamba mtu hunywa maji ya ziada ya ndugu yake, na yule anayekunywa maji ya ziada ya ndugu yake kwa ajili ya radhi ya Allah, daraja sabini huinuliwa kwake.))"
"920","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayempa Muislamu funda la maji ambapo maji yanapatikana, ni kana kwamba amemwachilia huru mtumwa; na yule anayempa Muislamu funda la maji ambapo maji hayapatikani, ni kana kwamba amempa uhai nafsi muumini.))"
"921","[AI-translation] ((Mnywesheni maji juu ya maji wakati wa siku za joto; dhambi zenu zitaanguka kama majani yanavyoanguka kutoka mti katika upepo mkali na mkali.))"
"922","[AI-translation] ((Katika chakula, mchele ni kama kiongozi miongoni mwa watu.))"
"923","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekula mchele kwa siku arobaini, chemchemi za hekima hutiririka kutoka moyoni mwake hadi ulimini mwake.))"
"924","[AI-translation] ((Mchele unatoka kwangu nami natoka kwa mchele. Niliuumba mchele kutoka mabaki ya nuru yangu.))"
"925","[AI-translation] ((Hakikisha tumieni dengu kwa sababu ni zenye baraka na safi.))"
"926","[AI-translation] ((Hakikisha tumieni dengu, kwani zilitakaswa juu ya ndimi za manabii sabini.))"
"927","[AI-translation] ((Kuna tiba ya kila ugonjwa katika mbiringani, wala hakuna ugonjwa humo.))"
"928","[AI-translation] ((Kuleni mbiringani kwa wingi, kwani hakika ni mti wa kwanza niliouona Peponi al-Ma'wa.))"
"929","[AI-translation] ((Tikiti, kabla ya kula chakula, huosha tumbo na huondoa kabisa ugonjwa.))"
"930","[AI-translation] ((Masika ya umma wangu ni zabibu na tikiti.))"
"931","[AI-translation] ((Kuleni boga, kwani huongeza akili.))"
"932","[AI-translation] ((Ee Ali! Unapochukua riziki kwa safari, usisahau vitunguu.))"
"933","[AI-translation] ((Hakikisha tumieni vitunguu, kwa sababu hutakasa manii na mtoto huzaliwa.))"
"934","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyekula tango na nyama alilindwa kutokana na ugonjwa wa ukoma.))"
"935","[AI-translation] ((Moyo wa muumini ni mtamu; hupenda tu utamu.))"
"936","[AI-translation] ((Hakika wale wenye njaa duniani watashibishwa Akhera.))"
"937","[AI-translation] ((Jibini ni ugonjwa na walnut pia ni ugonjwa, lakini viwili vinapochanganyika, huwa tiba.))"
"938","[AI-translation] ((Mkuu wa mafuta ni mafuta ya banafsi, na ubora wa mafuta ya banafsi miongoni mwa mafuta ni kama ubora wa Uislamu miongoni mwa dini zote.))"
"939","[AI-translation] ((Kutakuwa na baraka katika nyumba ya yule mwenye mbuzi nyumbani mwake.))"
"940","[AI-translation] ((Msimtukane jogoo kwa sababu ni rafiki yangu nami ni rafiki yake.))"
"941","[AI-translation] (([Abu al-Bakhtari alimwendea Khalifa Harun al-Rashid na akamkuta akirusha njiwa. Alipoona hili, alizua na kusimulia mapokeo haya ili kumridhisha Khalifa:] Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akirusha njiwa.))"
"942","[AI-translation] ((Isipokuwa kunguru na tai, hakuna dhara katika kula ndege wote.))"
"943","[AI-translation] ((Nungunungu... ni miongoni mwa wanyama najisi miongoni mwa wanyama najisi.))"
"944","[AI-translation] ((Hakika hii ni israfu: kula wakati wowote utakapo.))"
"945","[AI-translation] ((Kula udongo huongoza kwenye unafiki.))"
"946","[AI-translation] ((Kula udongo kumeharamishwa kwa kila Muislamu.))"
"947","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyekula udongo na akaoga nao, [ni kana kwamba] amekula nyama ya baba yake Adam (amani iwe juu yake) na akaoga kwa damu yake.))"
"948","[AI-translation] Masahaba wakauliza: Ee Mtume wa Allah! Dhabihu hizi ni nini? Akajibu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam): Ni desturi ya baba yenu Ibrahim (amani iwe juu yake). Masahaba wakauliza: Ni thawabu gani kwetu humo? Akajibu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam): Kwa kila unywele, kuna jema."
"949","[AI-translation] Mtu alimuuliza Sayyiduna Ibn Umar (Allah awaridhie) kuhusu dhabihu, kama ni faradhi. Akajibu: Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) na Waislamu wamefanya dhabihu. Kisha akakuuliza swali lile lile tena, basi ukasema: Je, unaelewa? Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) na Waislamu wamefanya dhabihu."
"950","[AI-translation] ((Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikaa Madina kwa miaka kumi na akatoa dhabihu [Qurbani] kila mwaka.))"
"951","[AI-translation] ((Tarehe kumi ya Dhul-Hijjah, mwana wa Adam hafanyi tendo lolote linalopendwa zaidi na Allah kuliko kumwaga damu [kutoa dhabihu]. Wanyama hawa watakuja Siku ya Kiama na pembe zao, kwato zao, na nywele zao. Kabla damu haijaangukia ardhini, hupata nafasi kwa Allah. Basi, toeni dhabihu yenu kwa moyo wa furaha.))"
"952","[AI-translation] (([Sayyiduna Ali (Allah amridhie) alisema kwamba] Mtume wa Allah, Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam, alinisia kutoa dhabihu kwa niaba yake, basi natoa dhabihu kwa niaba yake.))"
"953","[AI-translation] ((Udi, sandalwood, miski, amber, na kafuri ni mavazi ya Adam (amani iwe juu yake) ambayo aliteremshwa nayo kutoka Peponi.))"
"954","[AI-translation] ((Goti la mwanaume limojumuishwa katika 'awra [sehemu za siri za kufunikwa].))"
"955","[AI-translation] ((Kuswali kwa kilemba ni sawa na swala ishirini na tano [bila kilemba], na kuswali swala ya Ijumaa kwa kilemba ni sawa na Ijumaa sabini [bila kilemba].))"
"956","[AI-translation] ((Thawabu ya kuswali kwa kilemba kichwani ni sawa na ile ya jihad katika njia ya Allah.))"
"957","[AI-translation] ((Fungeni kilemba, mtaongezeka uvumilivu na subira.))"
"958","[AI-translation] ((Hakikisha vaeni vilemba, kwani hakika ni alama ya malaika.))"
"959","[AI-translation] ((Tofauti baina yetu na washirikina ni kufunga vilemba juu ya kofia.))"
"960","[AI-translation] ((Mavazi ya malaika hufikia hadi nusu ya mguu.))"
"961","[AI-translation] ((Kunjeni nguo zenu [yaani zipangeni vizuri], roho zao hurudi kwao. Hakika, Shetani akipata nguo zilizokunjwa, hazivai, lakini akipata nguo zilizotawanyika, huzivaa.))"
"962","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayetaka kukaa na Allah akae na wale wanaovaa mavazi ya sufi.))"
"963","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alifariki hali ya kuvaa mavazi ya sufi.))"
"964","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akivaa shuka [mkanda] mgongoni mwake.))"
"965","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayefunga ngamia na kuvaa mavazi ya sufi yuko huru kutokana na kiburi.))"
"966","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayevaa viatu vya njano atabaki katika furaha maadamu anaendelea kuvivaa.))"
"967","[AI-translation] ((Alama ya mnafiki ni kwamba suruali yake ni ndefu.))"
"968","[AI-translation] ((Swala kwa pete ni sawa na swala sabini bila pete.))"
"969","[AI-translation] ((Vaeni pete ya aqeeq, ni yenye baraka.))"
"970","[AI-translation] ((Vingi vya vito Peponi ni vya agate.))"
"971","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayevaa pete ya aqeeq ataona daima kheri na fadhila.))"
"972","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayevaa pete yenye jiwe la yakuti, Allah Mtukufu huondoa umasikini wake.))"
"973","[AI-translation] ((Vaeni zumaridi [jiwe la thamani]; ni nyepesi, hakuna kigumu humo.))"
"974","[AI-translation] ((Kutumia katika njia ya Allah ni sawa na dirhamu mia saba, ilhali kutumia dirhamu moja kwa kupaka rangi ni sawa na dirhamu elfu saba.))"
"975","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekufa na rangi akiwa amepaka [nywele], Munkar na Nakir hawatamuuliza kaburini.))"
"976","[AI-translation] ((Yule aliyekuza sharubu ndefu duniani, Allah, Bwana wa Heshima, atamrefushia majuto yake Siku ya Kiama.))"
"977","[AI-translation] ((Malaika wa mbinguni huwaombea maghfira wanawake wenye nywele za paji na wanaume wenye ndevu, na husema: Utukufu ni kwa yule aliyewapamba wanaume kwa ndevu na wanawake kwa nywele.))"
"978","[AI-translation] ((Mmoja wenu asikate ndevu, hata hivyo anaweza kupunguza nywele za paji.))"
"979","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akipunguza ndevu zake kutoka urefu na upana.))"
"980","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayechana kichwa na ndevu zake kila usiku hupewa ulinzi kutokana na aina mbalimbali za mitihani, na umri wake pia huongezwa.))"
"981","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayechana nywele zake hali ya kusimama, deni humwandama.))"
"982","[AI-translation] ((Chanuo hakikuwahi kutengana na Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) wakati wa safari au nyumbani.))"
"983","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayekata kucha zake siku ya Jumamosi, ugonjwa huondoka kwake na uponya huingia humo.))"
"984","[AI-translation] ((Hakika ua la waridi liliumbwa kutokana na jasho la Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam).))"
"985","[AI-translation] ((Usiku nilipochukuliwa kwenye safari [yaani usiku wa Mi'raj], baadhi ya jasho langu liliangukia ardhini, na kutokana nalo ua la waridi lilimea. Basi yule anayetaka kunusa harufu yangu anuse waridi.))"
"986","[AI-translation] ((Manukato yakiletwa kwa mmoja wenu, hakika apake, na kitu kitamu kikiletwa, pia hakika ale.))"
"987","[AI-translation] ((Mkuu wa mimea yenye harufu nzuri ya Pepo ni hina.))"
"988","[AI-translation] ((Uvumba [ute wa mti wenye miiba] ni harufu yangu na ya malaika.))"
"989","[AI-translation] ((Nuseni ua la nargis, iwe mara moja kwa siku, mara moja kwa mwezi, mara moja kwa mwaka, au hata mara moja maishani.))"
"990","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akipaka wanja kila usiku, akifanya hijama kila mwezi, na akitumia dawa kila mwaka.))"
"991","[AI-translation] ((Katika hali za wazimu, ukoma, na barasi, hijama ifanywe kichwani.))"
"992","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayetaka kufanyiwa hijama afanye tarehe kumi na saba, kumi na tisa, au ishirini na moja [ya mwezi].))"
"993","[AI-translation] ((Fanyiwa hijama tarehe kumi na tano, kumi na saba, kumi na tisa, au ishirini na moja ya mwezi.))"
"994","[AI-translation] ((Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikataza hijama siku ya Jumamosi na Jumatano.))"
"995","[AI-translation] ((Siku ya Ijumaa, kuna saa ambayo mtu akifanyiwa hijama humo, atakufa.))"
"996","[AI-translation] ((Siku moja ya homa ni kafara ya dhambi za mwaka.))"
"997","[AI-translation] ((Kuna tiba ya kila ugonjwa katika kunywa maji ya ziada ya udhu wa muumini, ndogo yake ni huzuni.))"
"998","[AI-translation] ((Mate ya muumini pia ni tiba.))"
"999","[AI-translation] ((Chakula cha mbahiri ni ugonjwa, ilhali chakula cha mkarimu ni tiba.))"
"1000","[AI-translation] ((Tumbo ni nyumba ya magonjwa, na kujiepusha ni msingi wa tiba.))"
"1001","[AI-translation] ((Tumbo ni ghala la mwili; mishipa yote hushukia humo. Tumbo likiwa na afya, mishipa itarudi na afya, na tumbo likiharibika, mishipa itarudi na ugonjwa.))"
"1002","[AI-translation] ((Tiba ya jicho ni kwamba lisiguzwe.))"
"1003","[AI-translation] ((Kupoteza macho ni maghfira ya dhambi, kupoteza kusikia ni maghfira ya dhambi, na vivyo hivyo, kila madhara kwa mwili ni njia ya maghfira ya dhambi.))"
"1004","[AI-translation] ((Madhara ya mguu mmoja wa mtu huwa njia ya maghfira ya nusu ya dhambi zake, ilhali madhara ya miguu miwili huwa njia ya maghfira ya dhambi zake zote.))"
"1005","[AI-translation] ((Yule anayeramba asali tumbo tupu siku tatu kila mwezi hatapatwa na ugonjwa wowote mkubwa.))"
"1006","[AI-translation] ((Mtume Mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alishika mkono wa mgonjwa wa ukoma na akauweka katika chombo kilichokuwa naye, na akasema: Shiriki katika kula, ukiamini na kumtegemea Allah Mtukufu.))"
"1007","[AI-translation] ((Katika tiba, matibabu ya mwisho ni kuunguza.))"
"1008","[AI-translation] ((Sura Al-Fatiha ni tiba ya kila ugonjwa.))"
